{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/extras/3e8fedba7a65b15a2164d05bcf2cd2b3.avif?t=1771826383\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexahedral</strong> is a challenging, cuboid, physics-based, 3D platformer with precise mechanics and a <i>dark, surreal atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Here, you control a <strong>red cube</strong> whose <strong>movements are</strong> <strong>physics based</strong>,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you need to <strong>learn how your movements work</strong> and <strong>how to jump properly</strong> to <i>surpass</i> a <strong>challenging and confusing</strong> path<strong>\u00a0</strong>so you can reach <i><strong>as high as you can.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You also have the ability to <strong>rewind time by 2 seconds</strong> in the case you <strong>fall down</strong>. It's not much, but it's enough to <i>save a life.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is <i>intentionally</i> <strong>difficult</strong> and <i>confusing</i> at times, <i>forcing</i> you to explore the map and <strong>find your own path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The mechanics are simple\u2014but require <i><strong>time and patience</strong></i> to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will face <i>numerous challenges</i> in a <i>square, dark, and lifeless world</i>, where every jump <i><strong>depends</strong></i><strong> entirely on you</strong> and your own abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So, <i><strong>don't give up</strong></i>. <i>Breathe slowly. Drink some water. Take another pill. <strong>Be patient, relax...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And remember: <u><i><strong>it can always get worse.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/extras/87d05f2773990650454aaca3f1a32920.avif?t=1771826383\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexahedral</strong> is a message \u2014 for those brave enough to hear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not what one desires, but what one needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game was made to convey a dark, oppressive, suffocating, and desolate experience \u2014 a feeling of torpor, twilight, and dissonance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During development, <strong>Hexahedral</strong> ended up becoming an artistic project in which I incorporated my deepest feelings, my most agonizing frustrations, and my most disturbed desires into every fragment of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I created a art work without restrictions, without fear of showing what I truly feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This project became the culmination of my enclosed nullity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps it's daring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps it's too insulting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However... it's <strong>honest.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138620?t=1771826383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/20be14ed9f5fc3ac0e4b0e6410acf4de3edefc8c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771826383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/4dc2fa38b587bbcf2607d19dad49ed846fd0d0f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771826383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/4dc2fa38b587bbcf2607d19dad49ed846fd0d0f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771826383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains sensitive themes related to mental health and may not be suitable for all players. Please play with caution."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/extras/3e8fedba7a65b15a2164d05bcf2cd2b3.avif?t=1771826383\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexahedral</strong> is a challenging, cuboid, physics-based, 3D platformer with precise mechanics and a <i>dark, surreal atmosphere.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Here, you control a <strong>red cube</strong> whose <strong>movements are</strong> <strong>physics based</strong>,<strong>\u00a0</strong>you need to <strong>learn how your movements work</strong> and <strong>how to jump properly</strong> to <i>surpass</i> a <strong>challenging and confusing</strong> path<strong>\u00a0</strong>so you can reach <i><strong>as high as you can.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You also have the ability to <strong>rewind time by 2 seconds</strong> in the case you <strong>fall down</strong>. It's not much, but it's enough to <i>save a life.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game is <i>intentionally</i> <strong>difficult</strong> and <i>confusing</i> at times, <i>forcing</i> you to explore the map and <strong>find your own path.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The mechanics are simple\u2014but require <i><strong>time and patience</strong></i> to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will face <i>numerous challenges</i> in a <i>square, dark, and lifeless world</i>, where every jump <i><strong>depends</strong></i><strong> entirely on you</strong> and your own abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So, <i><strong>don't give up</strong></i>. <i>Breathe slowly. Drink some water. Take another pill. <strong>Be patient, relax...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And remember: <u><i><strong>it can always get worse.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/extras/87d05f2773990650454aaca3f1a32920.avif?t=1771826383\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hexahedral</strong> is a message \u2014 for those brave enough to hear it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not what one desires, but what one needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This game was made to convey a dark, oppressive, suffocating, and desolate experience \u2014 a feeling of torpor, twilight, and dissonance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">During development, <strong>Hexahedral</strong> ended up becoming an artistic project in which I incorporated my deepest feelings, my most agonizing frustrations, and my most disturbed desires into every fragment of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I created a art work without restrictions, without fear of showing what I truly feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This project became the culmination of my enclosed nullity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps it's daring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perhaps it's too insulting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However... it's <strong>honest.</strong></p>","developers":["Limas Apenas"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138620/cbafba3943d7d14dfdfec16140177d16eaa0996d/header.jpg?t=1771826383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138620/1707807847/0a675ab9a4f9b4e89bc8876640749882871a8e6d/1761711340/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762468782","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138620/1707807847/0a675ab9a4f9b4e89bc8876640749882871a8e6d/1761711340/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762468782","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4138620/1707807847/0a675ab9a4f9b4e89bc8876640749882871a8e6d/1761711340/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762468782","id":257223934,"name":"Hexahedral - Launch trailer (EN)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257223934/105894b1c54c0cdff84710d54e2a2014deaab3d1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762468782"}],"name":"Hexahedral","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Hexahedral - $2.99 USD","packageid":1450016,"percen